    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43791" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐέξοδος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>easy to get out of</i> or
				<i>escape from</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔστι δ᾽ οὐκ εὐέξοδον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					688
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐ. χώρα</span>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυσέμβολος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1326b41
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1330b2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>easily escaping</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδωρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					874a32
				</span></i>
			.</div>
